    "description": "I need help filling my sales pipeline with fresh, accurate leads for the clothing business niche. Your focus will be pure lead generation\u2014sourcing and qualifying prospects so my team can step straight into outreach.  \n\nHere is what success looks like for me:  \n\u2022 A weekly spreadsheet (Excel / Google Sheets) of verified decision-makers or buyers in clothing companies, complete with name, role, company, email, phone, website, and LinkedIn profile.  \n\u2022 Leads must be current and relevant to the garments, apparel, or fashion-accessories space; general \u201ctechnology\u201d or \u201cfinance\u201d contacts will not be useful.  \n\u2022 Minimum 90 % email validity; I will run bulk-validation on delivery. Invalid or bounced addresses need to be replaced in the next batch at no extra cost.  \n\u2022 Notes on how each lead was sourced (trade show list, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, directory scrape, etc.) so I can replicate the approach if needed.  \n\nFeel free to use the tools you\u2019re most comfortable with\u2014LinkedIn, Apollo, Hunter.io, Clearbit, or any web-scraping stack\u2014as long as the data is reliable and GDPR-compliant. If you have an existing database that fits my criteria, even better.  \n\nPlease outline:  \n1. Your proposed lead volume per week.  \n2. The data enrichment methods you rely on to keep accuracy high.  \n3. A short sample of 5\u201310 leads from the clothing sector to prove quality.  \n\nOnce we agree on the workflow, I\u2019m ready to start immediately and grow the partnership if the first batch meets the acceptance criteria above.",
